    {
      "id": "claim_9ccd07800fa24ddd8ddeb40174a6c3ff",
      "statement": "Account allowlisting is implemented via the ROSA_TA_ALLOWED_ACCOUNTS environment variable, read into config.Config.AllowedAccounts, and set per regional deployment through terraform/regional/ecs.tf's var.allowed_accounts (part of the same container_environment block that also sets ROSA_TA_S3_BUCKET/ROSA_TA_S3_KEY_PREFIX and DATABASE_URL), functioning as a preventive control independent of and complementary to the audit-logging detective control.",
