    {
      "id": "claim_b0b2fac5dbdd4c679988110afc90f305",
      "statement": "Trusted Actions' audit pipeline (per-call audit.Record plus the CloudWatch-to-Firehose-to-S3 regional pipeline) is a distinct, unrelated system from ROSA Boundary's audit trail (CloudWatch session transcripts, S3 workspace snapshots, Bedrock payload logs, and CloudTrail), operating in a separate AWS footprint with its own buckets, log groups, and retention/Object Lock configuration; the two should not be described as unified or shared.",
