      "id": "claim_b94e6cdd697a43d0a2f6f5efdcae764e",
      "statement": "The SQLite database file backing AuditEntry and Execution persistence is stored on a Docker volume (sqlite-data) bound to host path /mnt/ecs-data on the single EC2 container instance running the Trusted Actions ECS service (aws_ecs_service.app sets desired_count = 1, launch_type = \"EC2\"), so losing that instance or its host volume loses all persisted audit entries and execution records with no redundancy or backup configured in this Terraform.",
