    {
      "id": "claim_7482bdb227534f5d8fa1a9712c07d30e",
      "statement": "The executor's audit.Logger is wired in cmd/server/main.go as audit.NewMockLogger(logger), the codebase's only production audit.Logger implementation, which keeps audit.Record values only in an in-process slice for tests and otherwise relies solely on its logrus line (tagged \"audit record\") reaching the CloudWatch-to-Firehose-to-S3 pipeline for durability; a comment in main.go documents that this per-action audit.Logger and the request-level AuditEntry store predate each other and were never unified into one persisted trail.",
